{"kind":30402,"id":"8f1680c8d20228f6eb5f8d3263988ad1353a12602e08bb3d3f9c46d892ef90a6","pubkey":"cec4b2b2175f88d2eccbc82006455cfe1befb2f1f3fc22fd54c83e31db0e70ed","created_at":1792177074,"tags":[["d","product_1792176985739_616he"],["title","The Bitcoin Investment Handbook, Signed & Numbered Limited Copy"],["price","144.95","USD"],["type","simple","physical"],["visibility","on-sale"],["stock","8"],["summary","Signed and numbered copy as part of a limited set of 100"],["image","https://cdn.nostrcheck.me/3ed52f4c920a069c8e6f0d71554f875b6f643471b2edac27fe2c21390cf54468.png","800x600","0"],["image","https://cdn.nostrcheck.me/363d67c70fb0610b8695cb991245e3af02a661f5887610a856f60176b3b66f9a.png","800x600","1"],["t","Bitcoin"],["t","Bitcoin Books"],["spec","ISBN-13","979-8-234-06650-3"],["spec","Format","Hardcover"],["spec","Condition","New, unread, signed and numbered (#s 55-75)"],["spec","Trim Size","6.25 × 9.25 inches"],["spec","Special Features","riginal quantitative research, technical appendices, investment frameworks, illustrations, and extensive reference material."],["shipping_option","30406:cec4b2b2175f88d2eccbc82006455cfe1befb2f1f3fc22fd54c83e31db0e70ed:shipping_1792176922454_v77mk","90"]],"content":"At 976 pages, The Bitcoin Investment Handbook is the most comprehensive professional reference on Bitcoin investing ever written. The definitive guide to Bitcoin investing—so investors can evaluate, value, and allocate to Bitcoin with institutional discipline. Comprehensive in every respect, this book has something for everyone.\n\nThe Bitcoin Investment Handbook helps professional investors clearly understand sources of value, elements of risk, portfolio role, and implementation considerations.\n\nInstead of relying on headlines, price charts, or promotional claims, readers get a disciplined way to judge Bitcoin with evidence. Major scientific and economic frameworks are brought together so investors can understand and evaluate:\n\n• What Bitcoin is and why it has value\n• Whether fixed supply can support durable monetary value\n• What can break: protocol risk, custody risk, exchange risk, and governance risk\n• How proof of work, mining, settlement, and forks affect investment judgment\n• How network growth, adoption curves, and monetary design support valuation\n• What price, value, utility, liquidity, and risk imply for position sizing\n• Trade-offs among spot Bitcoin, ETFs, trusts, miners, and related equities\n• How Bitcoin changes portfolio construction, rebalancing, and risk budgeting\n• How to evaluate Bitcoin across inflation, crisis, treasury, and reserve use cases\n• How to justify the decision for clients, committees, and fiduciaries\n\nAbout the Author\n\nTimothy F. Peterson, CFA, CAIA, is a recognized and leading global authority on Bitcoin investment and valuation. With 30 years of institutional asset management experience, he brings Wall Street discipline to digital assets. Peterson authored the first peer-reviewed methodology for valuing Bitcoin using Metcalfe’s Law, helping establish network economics as a serious framework for Bitcoin valuation. His research has been accessed by investors in more than 100 countries. SSRN ranks him among the top 0.2% of authors worldwide across all topics. His insights have appeared in Forbes, Newsweek, Yahoo Finance, Investing.com, CoinDesk, Cointelegraph, and he was featured in Mastering Crypto Assets alongside other prominent industry figures.\n\nPeterson is the author of two other books, one on alternative investments and one on monetary history. He has served as an instructor for graduate and undergraduate finance coursework, created and taught an MBA-level course on blockchain and network economics, and created and taught the popular Introduction to Digital Assets course at the Graduate School of Banking at LSU. He holds degrees in finance and economics from the University of Colorado and has completed the prestigious program on Investment Decisions and Behavioral Finance at the Harvard Kennedy School of Government.","sig":"b6908ab9cfe5a6f789c4d295847faa1b5d102ee60cc34c6fe7f38fb370547b521cb3a37ea8dd3d909d8f730cda15ff71e5e105f612c7aff5a6b56c82a57dab5f"}
